1
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:08,940
=When the Lights Rise=
=Episode 13=

2
00:01:12,580 --> 00:01:13,460
Come back with me.

3
00:01:15,820 --> 00:01:17,060
Do you hear me?

4
00:01:17,180 --> 00:01:18,260
I'm not going back.

5
00:01:19,380 --> 00:01:21,140
Why do you insist on staying here?

6
00:01:21,300 --> 00:01:22,260
You said

7
00:01:23,320 --> 00:01:24,440
you wouldn't interfere in my life anymore.

8
00:01:24,820 --> 00:01:26,380
I can stay wherever I want.

9
00:01:26,980 --> 00:01:29,420
Since your sister wants to stay here,

10
00:01:29,580 --> 00:01:30,940
you should be grateful.

11
00:01:31,380 --> 00:01:34,300
Lowly moneylenders
and debt collectors like you

12
00:01:34,660 --> 00:01:36,220
should consider yourselves lucky

13
00:01:36,300 --> 00:01:38,460
to even set foot in the Kuang residence.

14
00:01:38,580 --> 00:01:40,900
Lending money and collecting debts
is still better than trafficking drugs

15
00:01:40,900 --> 00:01:42,020
and killing people for money.

16
00:01:43,220 --> 00:01:44,020
Ding Yiyi.

17
00:01:44,300 --> 00:01:45,620
You're coming home with me today.

18
00:01:45,620 --> 00:01:46,600
- How dare you!
- I'm not going back!

19
00:01:47,580 --> 00:01:49,180
I haven't even
settled our previous score.

20
00:01:49,180 --> 00:01:50,500
And now you're pushing your luck!

21
00:01:50,820 --> 00:01:51,620
Master Kuang.

22
00:01:51,980 --> 00:01:52,580
Please.

23
00:01:52,580 --> 00:01:53,340
Don't shoot.

24
00:01:55,820 --> 00:01:56,620
Get up.

25
00:01:56,660 --> 00:01:58,270
Zhao, just go home. Please.

26
00:01:58,580 --> 00:01:59,380
Get up.

27
00:02:00,220 --> 00:02:01,020
No.

28
00:02:01,500 --> 00:02:02,300
Get up!

29
00:02:03,860 --> 00:02:04,660
Ding Yiyi.

30
00:02:06,020 --> 00:02:07,580
Do you realize what you're doing?

31
00:02:07,580 --> 00:02:08,580
Zhao, please go home.

32
00:02:08,580 --> 00:02:09,740
I'm begging you.

33
00:02:10,220 --> 00:02:11,820
Can't you just pretend you don't have

34
00:02:11,820 --> 00:02:12,780
a sister anymore?

35
00:02:13,700 --> 00:02:14,700
Say that again.

36
00:02:15,300 --> 00:02:16,100
It's me.

37
00:02:17,620 --> 00:02:20,100
I don't want
to be a loan shark's sister anymore.

38
00:02:20,660 --> 00:02:22,540
I don't want to feel so inferior

39
00:02:22,540 --> 00:02:23,660
and be looked down on.

40
00:02:24,260 --> 00:02:25,300
I don't want to live

41
00:02:25,300 --> 00:02:26,940
in that half of a house anymore.

42
00:02:28,620 --> 00:02:31,220
I don't want to end up like our mother.

43
00:02:32,580 --> 00:02:34,060
I want to stay here.

44
00:02:34,060 --> 00:02:35,500
And I'm staying here.

45
00:02:36,820 --> 00:02:39,660
Yijie!

46
00:02:40,980 --> 00:02:42,060
What's all this about?

47
00:02:42,220 --> 00:02:43,340
Why are you in such a panic?

48
00:02:43,620 --> 00:02:44,540
What happened to Yijie?

49
00:02:44,620 --> 00:02:45,540
Where is he?

50
00:02:45,860 --> 00:02:46,900
And Mengde too.

51
00:02:47,420 --> 00:02:48,980
Why do they keep bringing
trouble upon this family?

52
00:02:49,620 --> 00:02:50,420
Mr. Ding.

53
00:02:51,380 --> 00:02:53,100
Mr. Ding, have you seen Yijie?

54
00:02:53,220 --> 00:02:54,700
Could Yijie have gone with you

55
00:02:54,700 --> 00:02:55,780
to see that woman too?

56
00:02:59,660 --> 00:03:00,460
Mrs. Kuang.

57
00:03:01,300 --> 00:03:02,420
Yijie was injured.

58
00:03:02,420 --> 00:03:03,220
He's in the hospital.

59
00:03:03,260 --> 00:03:04,940
Injured? Where was he hurt?

60
00:03:04,940 --> 00:03:05,860
How did it happen?

61
00:03:06,020 --> 00:03:07,980
He was attacked outside the church.

62
00:03:08,020 --> 00:03:08,820
What?

63
00:03:08,980 --> 00:03:10,380
My grandson was attacked?

64
00:03:10,900 --> 00:03:11,780
How badly is he hurt?

65
00:03:12,020 --> 00:03:13,460
But don't worry, Mrs. Kuang.

66
00:03:13,820 --> 00:03:15,540
The doctors managed to save him.

67
00:03:15,620 --> 00:03:16,820
He's at St. Luke's Hospital.

68
00:03:16,820 --> 00:03:18,300
Ask for Dr. Bai Mali.

69
00:03:18,780 --> 00:03:19,620
Dr. Bai Mali?

70
00:03:19,620 --> 00:03:20,140
Yijie.

71
00:03:20,620 --> 00:03:21,420
Yijie.

72
00:03:21,970 --> 00:03:22,420
Yijie!

73
00:03:22,420 --> 00:03:23,860
Master!

74
00:03:24,020 --> 00:03:26,020
Dad!

75
00:03:26,380 --> 00:03:27,580
Get the family doctor.

76
00:03:28,020 --> 00:03:28,820
Take the master home.

77
00:03:28,820 --> 00:03:29,780
My poor Yijie.

78
00:03:29,780 --> 00:03:30,540
Dad.

79
00:03:30,780 --> 00:03:32,020
My Yijie.

80
00:03:43,020 --> 00:03:43,820
Yiyi.

81
00:03:46,820 --> 00:03:49,140
I know a lot has happened lately.

82
00:03:51,300 --> 00:03:52,340
There are things
you don't want to tell me.

83
00:03:52,340 --> 00:03:53,060
Am I right?

84
00:03:57,020 --> 00:03:58,140
But you need to know

85
00:03:59,420 --> 00:04:00,460
I'm your brother.

86
00:04:02,060 --> 00:04:04,100
What could you
possibly be unable to tell me?

87
00:04:10,580 --> 00:04:11,380
I'm sorry.

88
00:04:15,820 --> 00:04:17,420
I failed to protect you.

89
00:04:24,620 --> 00:04:27,260
Yiyi, please tell me, all right?

90
00:04:30,620 --> 00:04:31,940
Then let me ask you one more time.

91
00:04:34,220 --> 00:04:35,740
Will you come home with me?

92
00:04:37,700 --> 00:04:38,700
No.

93
00:04:54,420 --> 00:04:55,220
This

94
00:04:57,820 --> 00:04:59,020
was part of Mom's dowry.

95
00:05:00,100 --> 00:05:02,420
She nearly pawned it
to buy opium back then.

96
00:05:03,300 --> 00:05:05,980
Luckily, I hid it away.

97
00:05:07,020 --> 00:05:10,460
Now I'm giving it to you.

98
00:05:11,420 --> 00:05:13,020
I hope it keeps you safe.

99
00:05:17,820 --> 00:05:18,940
Take care of yourself.

100
00:06:12,860 --> 00:06:13,700
Where's Yiyi?

101
00:06:13,700 --> 00:06:15,020
You didn't bring her home?

102
00:06:15,020 --> 00:06:16,020
She's at the Kuang residence.

103
00:06:19,780 --> 00:06:20,740
The Kuang residence?

104
00:06:21,220 --> 00:06:23,060
Why would they let Yiyi stay?

105
00:06:23,100 --> 00:06:24,780
Lv Mengde demanded it?

106
00:06:24,820 --> 00:06:26,420
Yiyi herself wanted to stay.

107
00:06:26,420 --> 00:06:27,720
And Kuang Jinpeng agreed.

108
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:28,120
(Clothing Factory Income and Expenses)

109
00:06:28,220 --> 00:06:30,020
There's only one reason he'd do that.

110
00:06:30,420 --> 00:06:32,100
Yiyi is already pregnant.

111
00:06:33,380 --> 00:06:34,780
Where have you been these past few days?

112
00:06:34,820 --> 00:06:35,780
What did the doctor say?

113
00:06:35,820 --> 00:06:37,060
The doctor said it was nothing serious

114
00:06:37,060 --> 00:06:37,860
and I didn't need treatment.

115
00:06:37,860 --> 00:06:39,140
Which hospital did you go to?

116
00:06:39,580 --> 00:06:40,700
Which doctor did you see?

117
00:06:40,820 --> 00:06:42,660
The French doctor
at St. Luke's Hospital.

118
00:06:44,020 --> 00:06:44,900
Her name was Bai something.

119
00:06:44,900 --> 00:06:46,180
How is Yiyi's health?

120
00:06:46,380 --> 00:06:48,100
She's showing some signs of addiction,

121
00:06:48,460 --> 00:06:50,060
but it's still manageable.

122
00:06:50,700 --> 00:06:51,580
As for anything else,

123
00:06:51,660 --> 00:06:52,420
I promised her

124
00:06:52,420 --> 00:06:53,540
I wouldn't tell anyone.

125
00:06:56,780 --> 00:06:58,100
Lv Mengde has disappeared too.

126
00:06:58,260 --> 00:06:59,420
How did this happen?

127
00:06:59,420 --> 00:07:00,100
Uncle.

128
00:07:00,620 --> 00:07:01,580
All our valuables

129
00:07:01,580 --> 00:07:03,020
and the account books
are in this suitcase.

130
00:07:03,020 --> 00:07:04,180
Go pack a couple of changes of clothes.

131
00:07:04,180 --> 00:07:05,100
Don't bring too much.

132
00:07:05,100 --> 00:07:06,140
Tonight,

133
00:07:06,340 --> 00:07:07,260
you have to leave this place.

134
00:07:07,260 --> 00:07:08,140
Why?

135
00:07:08,580 --> 00:07:10,660
What did you do at the funeral?

136
00:07:10,700 --> 00:07:12,100
I wasn't involved in any of it.

137
00:07:12,260 --> 00:07:13,380
I'm not leaving.

138
00:07:15,020 --> 00:07:15,820
Uncle.

139
00:07:16,020 --> 00:07:17,260
Please stop asking questions.

140
00:07:17,260 --> 00:07:19,100
I'll come get you in a little while.

141
00:07:19,100 --> 00:07:20,700
Am I still your elder or not?

142
00:07:20,860 --> 00:07:22,060
How can you make decisions like this

143
00:07:22,060 --> 00:07:23,300
without discussing them with me?

144
00:07:23,580 --> 00:07:24,860
Where are you off to?

145
00:07:28,740 --> 00:07:29,540
Boss Ren.

146
00:07:30,380 --> 00:07:31,740
Are you fleeing from trouble,

147
00:07:32,420 --> 00:07:35,380
or going to join Lv Mengde?

148
00:07:39,460 --> 00:07:40,740
I need to settle
my family somewhere safe

149
00:07:41,220 --> 00:07:43,580
so I can carry out
your assignment, Boss Ren.

150
00:07:46,380 --> 00:07:47,780
Ding Zhao.

151
00:07:50,420 --> 00:07:54,260
I'm starting to have my doubts about you.

152
00:07:54,620 --> 00:07:58,100
Are you secretly
loyal to the other side?

153
00:07:58,380 --> 00:08:00,740
Have you already forgotten

154
00:08:00,740 --> 00:08:02,180
your promise to find someone for me?

155
00:08:04,420 --> 00:08:05,580
Rest assured, Boss Ren.

156
00:08:06,300 --> 00:08:08,500
When I, Ding Zhao, make a promise,

157
00:08:08,690 --> 00:08:10,180
I always keep it.

158
00:08:10,500 --> 00:08:11,660
Then how did things

159
00:08:12,220 --> 00:08:14,260
go so badly wrong at the church?

160
00:08:14,260 --> 00:08:15,380
I was working alone, with little support.

161
00:08:16,380 --> 00:08:18,100
I couldn't cover every possibility.

162
00:08:18,260 --> 00:08:22,500
Are you trying to negotiate with me?

163
00:08:27,340 --> 00:08:28,140
Uncle.

164
00:08:39,780 --> 00:08:41,740
I want to be a detective inspector.

165
00:08:42,060 --> 00:08:44,020
I need men and authority

166
00:08:46,700 --> 00:08:49,260
to track down Lv Mengde

167
00:08:50,060 --> 00:08:51,740
and uncover the secrets behind all this.

168
00:08:54,560 --> 00:08:55,800
(Bring Honor to the Family)

169
00:09:19,200 --> 00:09:21,160
(Memorial Tablets)

170
00:09:28,340 --> 00:09:29,140
Master.

171
00:09:29,460 --> 00:09:30,900
The eldest young lady
has gone to the hospital.

172
00:09:30,900 --> 00:09:32,380
She said she won't be back tonight.

173
00:09:32,820 --> 00:09:35,140
Shouldn't we urge the police

174
00:09:35,180 --> 00:09:37,860
to catch whoever
injured the young master?

175
00:09:38,100 --> 00:09:40,500
Right now, catching
the culprit isn't what matters most.

176
00:09:40,900 --> 00:09:41,940
Saving him is.

177
00:09:42,900 --> 00:09:44,140
How is Yijie?

178
00:09:44,500 --> 00:09:45,300
He still hasn't woken up.

179
00:09:49,220 --> 00:09:50,060
What about Mengde?

180
00:09:50,220 --> 00:09:51,300
Have you found him?

181
00:09:51,300 --> 00:09:52,780
The whole family has been looking,

182
00:09:52,820 --> 00:09:53,740
but no one has found him.

183
00:09:54,300 --> 00:09:56,020
It's as if he's vanished into thin air.

184
00:09:56,860 --> 00:09:58,020
Vanished into thin air?

185
00:09:58,540 --> 00:09:59,340
Impossible.

186
00:10:01,180 --> 00:10:03,380
Mengde isn't the type to run away.

187
00:10:04,580 --> 00:10:05,460
Besides,

188
00:10:06,060 --> 00:10:06,980
even if he did flee,

189
00:10:07,620 --> 00:10:09,300
where could he possibly go?

190
00:10:25,420 --> 00:10:26,300
Mrs. Kuang.

191
00:10:38,140 --> 00:10:38,940
I'm sorry.

192
00:10:40,180 --> 00:10:41,700
I made this decision

193
00:10:41,900 --> 00:10:43,460
without asking your permission.

194
00:10:44,500 --> 00:10:46,300
This is what Xiaozhu would have wanted.

195
00:10:47,500 --> 00:10:49,780
Thank you for today.

196
00:10:49,980 --> 00:10:50,940
I didn't do it for you.

197
00:10:52,220 --> 00:10:53,420
I did it for her.

198
00:10:53,460 --> 00:10:54,420
For Xiaozhu?

199
00:10:56,380 --> 00:10:57,700
At the church,

200
00:10:57,700 --> 00:10:58,900
Yijie admitted to me

201
00:11:00,100 --> 00:11:01,860
that Xiaozhu had once saved him

202
00:11:02,060 --> 00:11:04,020
and was his best friend at school.

203
00:11:27,460 --> 00:11:28,100
Mom.

204
00:11:29,060 --> 00:11:30,340
I want to get some fresh air.

205
00:11:30,620 --> 00:11:31,580
Would you like me to come with you?

206
00:11:32,460 --> 00:11:33,260
No, thanks.

207
00:11:33,820 --> 00:11:34,980
I'll be back soon.

208
00:11:47,420 --> 00:11:48,260
Miss Mei.

209
00:11:49,900 --> 00:11:50,980
Let's put our differences

210
00:11:51,460 --> 00:11:52,700
behind us.

211
00:12:00,020 --> 00:12:01,340
Do you hear me?

212
00:12:02,220 --> 00:12:03,060
Please leave.

213
00:12:07,660 --> 00:12:08,580
Madam.

214
00:12:09,900 --> 00:12:13,020
Does Young Master Kuang
have any siblings?

215
00:12:17,620 --> 00:12:18,420
Does he?

216
00:12:21,820 --> 00:12:23,300
He's my only son.

217
00:12:24,580 --> 00:12:25,780
He's the only child I gave birth to.

218
00:12:31,680 --> 00:12:36,200
(Mysterious Woman Appears
as Church Goes Up in Flames)

219
00:12:36,300 --> 00:12:37,900
I know I shouldn't pry,

220
00:12:38,260 --> 00:12:40,100
but this matter is very important

221
00:12:40,100 --> 00:12:41,620
to both Xiaozhu and me.

222
00:12:50,020 --> 00:12:50,860
The truth is,

223
00:12:52,620 --> 00:12:54,620
I'm not Xiaozhu's biological sister.

224
00:12:56,060 --> 00:12:57,660
Not long after she was born,

225
00:12:58,060 --> 00:12:59,980
someone abandoned her
on the railroad tracks.

226
00:12:59,980 --> 00:13:00,820
You little brat,

227
00:13:00,820 --> 00:13:02,530
with no one to raise you!

228
00:13:02,970 --> 00:13:04,500
And you're still running this way?

229
00:13:04,740 --> 00:13:05,620
Catch him!

230
00:13:05,620 --> 00:13:07,100
I'll beat you to death!

231
00:13:08,380 --> 00:13:09,220
Oh, dear.

232
00:13:57,060 --> 00:13:58,300
I'm an orphan too.

233
00:14:00,020 --> 00:14:03,860
I'm afraid I can't afford to raise you.

234
00:14:04,260 --> 00:14:05,620
I'll have to leave it up to fate.

235
00:14:35,500 --> 00:14:37,820
Enough. Don't cry.

236
00:14:40,060 --> 00:14:43,020
As long as I have something to eat,

237
00:14:43,620 --> 00:14:45,060
I'll always share half with you.

238
00:14:47,580 --> 00:14:49,060
December 18

239
00:14:49,820 --> 00:14:51,820
was the day I found Xiaozhu.

240
00:14:52,980 --> 00:14:53,940
To commemorate it,

241
00:14:55,020 --> 00:14:56,860
I carved a bead
from a piece of scrap wood,

242
00:14:56,860 --> 00:14:57,980
strung it into a bracelet,

243
00:14:58,620 --> 00:14:59,820
and put it on her wrist.

244
00:15:01,700 --> 00:15:02,860
Every year after that,

245
00:15:02,860 --> 00:15:04,340
I'd add another bead.

246
00:15:05,220 --> 00:15:06,220
This gold one

247
00:15:06,460 --> 00:15:08,100
was bought with the tip you gave me

248
00:15:08,100 --> 00:15:09,300
when you first came

249
00:15:09,620 --> 00:15:11,180
to my shop to order a dress.

250
00:15:15,780 --> 00:15:17,060
And every year since,

251
00:15:18,380 --> 00:15:20,060
I've added another bead.

252
00:15:22,020 --> 00:15:25,620
Silver, glass, jade, or gemstones.

253
00:15:26,220 --> 00:15:28,700
There are exactly sixteen this year.

254
00:15:29,220 --> 00:15:31,700
We've depended
on each other for sixteen years.

255
00:15:32,620 --> 00:15:34,580
I never told her the truth.

256
00:15:35,100 --> 00:15:36,620
And she never asked.

257
00:15:39,620 --> 00:15:43,300
Not until
what happened at the Paris Hotel.

258
00:15:44,100 --> 00:15:44,900
Xiaozhu!

259
00:15:54,020 --> 00:15:55,060
During my investigation,

260
00:15:55,820 --> 00:15:56,860
everyone said

261
00:15:57,620 --> 00:15:59,420
Xiaozhu had a close older sister.

262
00:15:59,740 --> 00:16:01,500
The two had often
visited together recently.

263
00:16:01,780 --> 00:16:03,180
The older one looked a few years older.

264
00:16:03,260 --> 00:16:05,260
The younger one looked like a student.

265
00:16:05,620 --> 00:16:07,020
They looked quite alike.

266
00:16:07,300 --> 00:16:08,140
Very much alike?

267
00:16:08,550 --> 00:16:11,260
I think she must have found her family.

268
00:16:13,640 --> 00:16:15,380
But she kept it from me

269
00:16:15,860 --> 00:16:17,180
because she didn't want to upset me.

270
00:16:17,500 --> 00:16:18,700
This old scar

271
00:16:18,980 --> 00:16:20,300
doesn't look like an ordinary accident.

272
00:16:20,620 --> 00:16:22,100
The incision is very precise.

273
00:16:22,180 --> 00:16:25,660
It seems to be an ancient ritual wound.

274
00:16:25,900 --> 00:16:27,540
Identical wounds are cut

275
00:16:27,780 --> 00:16:29,140
into two people's abdomens,

276
00:16:29,420 --> 00:16:31,300
and they're pressed
together, skin to skin,

277
00:16:31,620 --> 00:16:32,660
so their flesh and blood can merge.

278
00:16:33,220 --> 00:16:34,740
It's usually performed on infants.

279
00:16:35,100 --> 00:16:37,420
Don't you think he looks like Xiaozhu?

280
00:16:37,710 --> 00:16:38,900
But I never imagined

281
00:16:39,220 --> 00:16:40,220
that this older sister

282
00:16:42,620 --> 00:16:44,300
would turn out to be Young Master Kuang.

283
00:16:58,480 --> 00:17:01,520
♪And watch the lights
come on one by one♪

284
00:17:02,080 --> 00:17:04,920
♪Like blades cutting
through the radiance♪

285
00:17:05,560 --> 00:17:08,400
♪You may treat me as dust
beneath your feet♪

286
00:17:08,400 --> 00:17:10,320
♪Or wipe me away like ashes♪

287
00:17:10,320 --> 00:17:11,880
♪Leaving a cold ending♪

288
00:17:11,880 --> 00:17:13,840
♪But I refuse to fall♪

289
00:17:13,840 --> 00:17:18,760
♪I refuse to become a shadow
fading beneath the lights♪

290
00:17:18,880 --> 00:17:21,320
♪I refuse to dissolve into♪

291
00:17:22,400 --> 00:17:25,400
♪The lifeless light of the past♪

292
00:17:25,720 --> 00:17:28,560
♪I want sharpness at my fingertips♪

293
00:17:28,600 --> 00:17:31,400
♪And steps that avoid
the traps among the thorns♪

294
00:17:32,120 --> 00:17:35,000
♪At dawn, I will look
straight into your eyes♪

295
00:17:35,000 --> 00:17:38,200
♪My gaze clear, illuminating the dawn♪

296
00:17:39,680 --> 00:17:42,440
♪Those who have hurt me♪

297
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:45,680
♪I choose to pierce through♪

298
00:17:47,280 --> 00:17:48,760
♪To tear apart♪

299
00:17:48,880 --> 00:17:54,760
♪To ignite a sacred flame♪

300
00:17:56,440 --> 00:17:58,560
♪I do not pray to the gods♪

301
00:17:58,560 --> 00:18:01,480
♪Nor bow to power♪

302
00:18:01,480 --> 00:18:03,760
♪I will no longer play the tragic lead♪

303
00:18:05,560 --> 00:18:09,480
♪I will stand and carve
the path of my own fate♪
